-
-     ∫ₐᵇ f(x) dx ≈ (b-a)π/(2n) ∑ᵢ₌₁ⁿ f(xᵢ)√(1-yᵢ²)
- 
- where:
- - yᵢ = cos((2i-1)π/(2n)) for i = 1, ..., n
- - xᵢ = (b-a)yᵢ/2 + (a+b)/2 
- - All quadrature weights are equal: π/n
