+# Arguments
+- `state`: [`P3State`](@ref)
+- `logλ`: the log of the slope parameter [log(1/m)]
+- `vel`: the velocity parameterization, e.g. [`CMP.Chen2022VelType`](@ref)
+- `ρₐ`: air density [kg/m³]
+
